  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Bengal : Kolkata Urban Services for the Poor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the quality of life and opportunities for 2.4 million poor people in the Kolkata Metropolitan Area (KMA) through support to the implementation of urban reforms and city sanitation plans. The FA component of this project came to an end in April 2011 and the TA component will end in December 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
